			"notes": "# Overlayer 1.0.2\n\n### 📖 Description\n\nAn in-game image overlay Mod for Minecraft. Display custom images anywhere on your game screen with full control over position, scale, opacity, and layer order. All settings are automatically saved, with multi-language support.\n\n### ✨ Changelog\n\n**First public release for 26.3 fabric**\n\n- Support for PNG, JPG, JPEG, BMP, GIF image formats\n- Adjust X/Y offset, rotation, scale, opacity, and layer order in real time\n- Four display modes: Always, In-Game Only, Not In-Game Only, Disabled\n- Live preview of images on the game screen while adjusting settings\n- Built-in language support: Simplified Chinese and English\n- Relative path support\n\n### 📦 Dependencies & Game Versions\n\n- Fabric 0.20.0+\n- Minecraft 26.3\n- Java 25+"
		},
