			"notes": "# Overlayer 1.0.2\n\n### ✨ Changelog\n\n- Fix GPU texture leaks and transparent preview rendering  \n- Fix thread pool leaks and implement async disk saving with atomic file writes  \n- Improve image loading speed with batch pixel reads (up to 20× faster)  \n- Optimize GIF playback with cached file checks and binary frame search (O(log n))  \n- Improve overlay rendering performance with dirty flag sorting, batched blend states, viewport culling, and skip zero-rotation matrix ops  \n- Reduce object allocations by caching image absolute paths  \n- Batch blend states for thumbnail rendering in image lists  \n- Optimize scroll panel updates with dirty flag to avoid per-frame child repositioning  \n- Skip rendering and tick calculations when no overlays are active  \n- Improve config UI thread safety and reduce slider message allocations\n\n\n### 📦 Dependencies & Game Versions\n\n- Fabric 0.17.1+\n- Minecraft 1.20\n- Java 21+\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Skrepy0/Overlayer/compare/f-v1.0.1-1.20...f-v1.0.2-1.20"
		},
